---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import Cta from '../components/Cta.astro';
import { site, steps } from '../data/site';
import { services } from '../data/services';
import { areas, groups } from '../data/areas';
const featured = ['cctv-drain-inspections','high-pressure-water-jetting','tree-root-removal'];
const symptoms = [
  { title: 'Toilet or gully overflowing?', text: 'Stop using affected fixtures and keep people and pets away from wastewater. Tell us whether more than one drain is backing up. Urgent calls are welcome 24/7.', href: '/services/emergency-blocked-drains', link: 'Get urgent drain guidance' },
  { title: 'The same drain keeps blocking?', text: 'Clearing can restore flow while a damaged joint, roots or a low section remains. Camera inspection after clearing can help explain why the problem returns.', href: '/services/cctv-drain-inspections', link: 'Understand CCTV inspection' },
  { title: 'Water pooling when it rains?', text: 'Leaves and sediment can restrict stormwater pipes. We assess the line and outlet because damaged pipes, insufficient capacity and surface runoff need different solutions.', href: '/services/blocked-stormwater-drains', link: 'Explore stormwater help' },
  { title: 'A slow sink or shower?', text: 'Hair, soap residue and kitchen grease can restrict local waste pipes. If several fixtures are slow, the cause may be farther down the line. Let us know which outlets are affected.', href: '/services/blocked-sinks-showers', link: 'Get fixture drain help' },
];
---
<Layout title="Blocked Drains Northern Beaches | Antons | 24/7 Calls" description="Blocked drains on the Northern Beaches? Call Antons on 0493 824 176 for CCTV inspections, drain jetting, root removal and repair options. NSW licence 210933C.">
  <section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><h1>Blocked drains.<br /><span>Clear answers.</span></h1><p>Get your Northern Beaches home flowing again. Expert drain clearing, camera inspections and repairs that deal with the cause.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button call" href={site.tel}>Call {site.phone}</a><a class="text-link" href="#symptoms">What’s going wrong?</a></div><ul class="hero-proof"><li>NSW licensed team</li><li>Real equipment. Real answers.</li></ul><p class="fine">Antons Blocked Drains North Beaches<br />Urgent calls welcome 24/7</p></div><figure class="hero-media"><Photo name="roots" alt="Antons team member holding a long root mass removed during drainage work" eager class="hero-main" /><Photo name="camera" alt="Antons technician inspecting a drain with CCTV equipment" class="hero-inset" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 128px, 190px" /><figcaption class="hero-caption"><span>Real roots. Real drainage work. The Antons team.</span><span>Inspect · Clear · Repair</span></figcaption></figure></section>
  <section class="urgent-strip"><div class="wrap"><div><strong>Sewage backing up right now?</strong><p>Stop using affected fixtures. Keep clear of wastewater. Call and describe what is happening.</p></div><a href="/services/emergency-blocked-drains">Get urgent help</a></div></section>
  <section class="section wrap symptom-layout" id="symptoms"><div class="symptom-intro"><h2>A blocked drain is a problem.<br /><span class="blue">Let’s find the cause.</span></h2><p>From a slow shower to a sewer overflow, the right solution starts with understanding the symptoms. Our licensed team explains what we find, what can be cleared and what may need a repair.</p><p class="muted">No need to diagnose it yourself. Tell us what you’ve noticed.</p></div><div class="symptom-list">{symptoms.map((s,i)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{s.title}</summary><div class="detail-content"><p>{s.text}</p><a href={s.href}>{s.link}</a></div></details>)}</div></section>
  <section class="section wrap" style="padding-top:0"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Equipped for more than<br />a temporary fix.</h2><p>Professional drainage work, from locating the obstruction to choosing a suitable repair. The method follows the condition of your pipe.</p></div><div class="service-grid">{services.filter(s=>featured.includes(s.slug)).map(s=><a class="service-tile" href={`/services/${s.slug}`}><Photo name={s.image} alt={s.alt} sizes="(max-width:760px) calc((100vw - 54px) / 2), (max-width:1304px) calc((100vw - 120px) / 3), 395px" /><h3>{s.name}</h3><p>{s.short}</p><span class="link-label">Explore the service</span></a>)}</div><div class="service-index">{services.filter(s=>!featured.includes(s.slug)).map(s=><a href={`/services/${s.slug}`}><strong>{s.name}</strong><span>View service</span></a>)}</div></section>
  <section class="section navy-section"><div class="wrap split"><figure><Photo name="pipe-repair" alt="Replacement drainage pipe with accessible junctions before backfilling" class="split-image" /><figcaption class="proof-caption">Real Antons pipework, photographed before backfilling.</figcaption></figure><div class="split-copy"><h2>Clear the blockage.<br />Know what comes next.</h2><p>Getting water moving is the first priority. Understanding why it stopped helps you make a better decision about the next step.</p><h3>Cleaning when the pipe is sound.</h3><p>Suitable jetting or mechanical clearing can remove grease, debris and accessible roots. We check flow and explain what the work has achieved.</p><h3>Repair when there’s a defect.</h3><p>A cracked joint, collapsed section or recurring root entry may need more than another clean. We explain suitable relining or replacement options and agree the scope with you.</p><a class="text-link" href="/drain-advice/jetting-relining-or-replacement">Compare clearing and repair options</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section wrap"><h2>A clear process.<br />From the first call to the final check.</h2><ol class="process">{steps.map(([title,text])=><li><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></li>)}</ol></section>
  <section class="section wrap" style="padding-top:0"><div class="section-heading"><h2>The people.<br />The equipment. The work.</h2><div><p>Your drainage is handled by the Antons team. See our people at work on drain inspections, clearing and pipe repairs.</p><a class="text-link" href="/our-work">See our work & job videos</a></div></div><div class="work-strip"><figure><Photo name="stocked-truck" alt="Antons technician selecting a tool case from the stocked service vehicle" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, 40vw" /><figcaption>Professional equipment, brought to the job.</figcaption></figure><figure><Photo name="junction" alt="Exposed drainage junctions and pipework laid in bedding" sizes="(max-width:760px) 45vw, 28vw" /><figcaption>Pipework and connections before backfilling.</figcaption></figure><figure><Photo name="finished-gully" alt="Finished ground surface around a gully grate and inspection cover" sizes="(max-width:760px) 45vw, 28vw" /><figcaption>Access points kept available after the work.</figcaption></figure></div></section>
  <section class="section related"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Drain help across<br />the Northern Beaches.</h2><p>From Manly and Dee Why to the Forest district and Palm Beach. Find advice for your area, then call to confirm access and availability.</p></div><div class="area-groups">{Object.entries(groups).map(([key,g])=><div class="area-group"><h3>{g.name}</h3><ul>{areas.filter(a=>a.group===key).map(a=><li><a href={`/service-areas/${a.slug}`}>{a.name}</a></li>)}</ul></div>)}</div><p class="coverage-note">Offshore, island and water-access properties need a specific access check. <a href="/service-areas">Search all service areas</a>.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section wrap split"><div class="split-copy"><h2>Licensed hands.<br />Straightforward advice.</h2><p>Antons Blocked Drains North Beaches is operated by {site.operator}, under NSW contractor licence {site.licence}. You’re dealing with the same Antons team behind the plumbing and drainage work shown here.</p><p>We explain the findings in plain language, discuss the proposed work and help you understand the difference between clearing an obstruction and repairing the cause.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about">Meet the team behind the service</a></div><div><blockquote class="quote">“David did exactly what he said he would, arrived on time, explained everything they did and showed me the results on the camera screen.”</blockquote><p class="quote-credit">Kristen P. · Antons customer review excerpt<br />Feedback about the wider Antons team. Job location not specified.</p></div></section>
  <Cta />
</Layout>
